sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant S as Scheduler
  participant R as Production Run
  participant A as Source Adapter
  participant V as Validator
  participant D as Data Store
  S->>R: trigger
  R->>R: select due sources
  loop every due source
    R->>A: fetch
    alt source answered
      A->>V: candidate data
      alt validation passed
        V->>D: store accepted file
        V-->>R: UPDATED or UNCHANGED
      else validation failed
        V-->>R: FAILED (file untouched)
      end
    else timeout or error
      A-->>R: FAILED (data kept)
    end
  end
  R->>D: rebuild as-of store
